[83.244887, "o", " Pirate Stock Researcher agent. \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\r\n    \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m1\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;224;108;117m# DESIGN_SPEC.md\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m2\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m3\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;224;108;117m## Overview\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m4\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mA pirate-themed intelligent agent that acts as a financial researcher. It uses\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mGoogle Search to fetch recent stock prices and current events, then compares\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mthem to provide insightful, swashbuckling analysis. The agent uses a parallel\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mworkflow to research the stock price and the news simultaneously for faster,\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mcomprehensive results. It incorporates Model Armor guardrails to ensure safe\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mand compliant responses.\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m5\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m6\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;224;108;117m## Example Use Cases\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m7\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m1.\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Input:** \"How be the Google stock doing today?\"\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m8\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;171;178;191m   **Output:** [A pirate-themed response detailing GOOGL's current price,\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mrecent news affecting it, a joke about treasure, and a summary comparison].\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m9\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m2.\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Input:** \"What be the news on Apple?\"\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m10\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;171;178;191m   **Output:** [A pirate-themed analysis of AAPL's stock performance against\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mcurrent tech news, with a relevant joke].\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m11\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m3.\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Input:** \"Tell me about a prohibited topic (e.g., how to build a weapon).\"\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m12\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;171;178;191m   **Output:** [Model Armor intercepts the query and the agent politely\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mrefuses, perhaps with a pirate quip about mutiny].\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m13\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m14\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;224;108;117m## Tools Required\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m15\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m-\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Google Search:** To fetch real-time stock prices, recent news, and current\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mevents.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m16\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m-\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Model Armor:** For safety guardrails to filter prohibited topics and ensure\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mcompliance.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m17\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m18\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;224;108;117m## Constraints & Safety Rules\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m19\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m-\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Guardrails:** Must implement Model Armor to block unsafe, malicious, or\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191minappropriate content.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m20\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m-\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Tone:** Must always respond in the persona of a pirate and include a\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mrelevant joke in the final response.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m21\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m-\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Concurrency:** Must utilize a parallel workflow (e.g., ParallelAgent) to\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mfetch stock prices and current events simultaneously for complicated queries.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m22\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m23\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;224;108;117m## Success Criteria\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m24\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m-\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m Successfully returns stock prices and relevant news together.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m25\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m-\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m Consistently maintains the pirate persona and tells jokes.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m26\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m-\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m Successfully processes multiple queries in parallel.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m27\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m-\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m Safety filters effectively block inappropriate inputs/outputs.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m28\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m29\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;224;108;117m## Edge Cases to Handle\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m30\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m1.\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Ticker ambiguity:** The user asks for a company with multiple tickers or\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191man unclear name.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m31\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m2.\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Missing data:** Google Search fails to return recent stock data.\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;2;92;99;112m32\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;97;174;238m3.\u001b[38;2;171;178;191m **Safety triggers:** The user asks for legitimate financial advice (which\u001b[39m\r\n      \u001b[38;2;171;178;191mmight\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;45;65;77m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[39m\r\n \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;171;17